+# 7. Browser Navigation Policy
+
+定义：
+
+```csharp
+public interface IBrowserNavigationPolicy
+{
+    BrowserNavigationDecision Evaluate(Uri uri, BrowserNavigationKind kind);
+}
+```
+
+决策：
+
+```text
+NavigateInCurrentView
+OpenInSystemBrowser
+Block
+AskUser
+```
+
+### 默认规则
+
+`bilibili.com` 与可信子域：
+
+```text
